# PWA Icons Directory

This directory contains PWA icons in various sizes.

## Generate Icons

Run the following command to generate all required icons:

```bash
node scripts/generate-pwa-icons.js public/medthread-logo-1.jpeg
```

Or use an online tool:
https://realfavicongenerator.net/

## Required Sizes

- 72x72
- 96x96
- 128x128
- 144x144
- 152x152
- 192x192
- 384x384
- 512x512
